# Rebuilt at a density of one texture pixel per half model pixel.
# The lower ring touches all four sides of the 4x4 Create shaft without an air gap.
# The diagonal runs use their exact endpoint-to-endpoint length so every joint remains closed.
mtllib rope.mtl
o rope

# bottom of the shaft ring
